│ brain tumors", "abstract": "The mechanism of epilepsy in brain tumor patients is probably multifactorial, and its    │
│ incidence depends on tumor type and location. Refractory epilepsy is common in patients with structural brain        │
│ lesions, and a role for multidrug-resistance proteins has been suggested. The medical treatment of epilepsy in brain │
